// KeyClue - AllCodesGathered 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1689707319" "Completed Codes"
// DetailString :
"P2918813865" "By piecing together all of the codes you've found on the villains of this dark future, you can make your way back home at last!"

