"P1509541266" "Dr. Aeon"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - AeonTaunts 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// 8 B_Boss :
"P1155343781" "<f=camera><em EvilLaugh>Ah-ha-ha-ha! <em point>You 'Stupor-powered' fools have fallen into my brilliant trap! Allow me to explain:"
// 8 B_Boss :
"P76937897" "<em lecture>That portal didn't send you to a secret base, instead it sent you into the future, where my Web device has allowed Lord Recluse to conquer the world!"
// 4 B_Boss :
"P3321173800" "<em EvilLaugh>Mwha-ha-ha!"
// 8 B_Boss :
"P3840240385" "<em talker>But don't worry, fools! I've made arrangements to have you captured by some of Arachnos's operatives here in the future. Like Regent Korol,"
// 3 B_Boss :
"P3410958928" "Magus Mu'Drakhan,"
// 3 B_Boss :
"P845748827" "Shadow Spider,"
// 3 B_Boss :
"P3970944636" "And Viridian,"
// 4 B_Boss :
"P2486789698" "<shout>Each has part of the code needed to open this door:"
// 4 B_Boss :
"P2505012268" "<shout>And set this portal to send you back to the present:"
// 8 B_Boss :
"P649876616" "<em thumbsup>So just sit tight and wait to be taken prisoner. <em No>And whatever you do, don't even think about fighting them! <em TalkToHand>There's no way you could win, so don't even try it!"
// 5 B_Boss :
"P1837925623" "I can't believe I just told them how to escape like that! <em GoAway>Okay, just erase this recording and we'll start again."
// 1 BM :
"P136183313" "<em RaiseHand>Uh, sir?"
// 2 B_Boss :
"P3454796002" "<f=BM><em Angry>What?"
// 3 BM :
"P84991353" "<em what>Uh... You said you wanted to transmit this, uh, live..."
// 5 B_Boss :
"P3692616013" "<f=camera><em Frustrated>AAAAH! Shut it off! Shut it off!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P4191778729" "Regent Korol"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1521684915" "I love it when they come to me!"
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P2810372134" "I haven't eaten a hero's mind in years!"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1165868062" "Aren't you a feisty one?"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1982785545" "Now that was uncalled for!"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1751589351" "You're making me very cross!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P3950920299" "This is impossible!"
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
