// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P1788260581" "Resisting Arachnos is pointless. We control the world, now."
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P394702988" "You're putting up a pretty decent fight. Interesting."
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P648487946" "This fight's getting a little too interesting."
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2020975615" "We've been misled! Is this a trap for you or for us?"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P3998777858" "Now I'll never find out... <em>What happens next... <em>On my favorite soap operas..."
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P1698050090" "One down. I'll send for a recovery team shortly."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - DefeatViridian 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P3127078563" "Defeat Viridian"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2182796" "You defeated Viridian, Head of Arachnos Counter-Intelligence, and got part of the information you'll need to get home."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - DoorFound 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - PathOut 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P3698340710" "Return Home"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3289215362" "You have all the codes needed to escape this dark future!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P797737049" "<color deepskyblue>Ms. Liberty  TASKFORCE:  'Evil's Foresight' <br>Part: Two<br><br></color>Time travel...<br><br>Why not? Dr. Aeon's crazy enough to do something like this. I'm glad you came through all right. <br><br>Despite the worst Dr. Aeon could throw at you, you overcame great adversity to get back here. All of your effort was not for nothing. The information you took from that twisted future, as well as what Dr. Aeon let slip, may give us an opportunity to stop this yet. <br><br>I've been talking with Numina, and we've come up with a plan."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3649239099" "<color deepskyblue>Ms. Liberty TASKFORCE:  'Plucking the Thorn' <br>Part: Three<br><br></color>Dr. Aeon will no doubt have other plans ready the next time you face him, but I've been talking with Numina and we've come up with a plan to neutralize any surprises he may have in store.<br><br>Numina's told me about a living nexus of mystical power beneath Thorn Island in the Nerva Archipelago. It's called the <color red>Thorn Tree</color>, and apparently villains often attack it, using the mystical power it gathers to re-make themselves. Numina tells me the power contained in the heart of the Thorn Tree is something called the <color red>Nexus of Thorns</color>. <br><br>We believe this should be enough to shut Dr. Aeon's defenses down, allowing you to capture him. This won't be easy, but if anyone has a chance, it will be you."
// AcceptString :
"P3410647705" "Strike the Thorn Tree"
// SendOffString :
"P816536165" "<color deepskyblue>Ms. Liberty TASKFORCE:  'Plucking the Thorn' <br>Part: Three<br><br></color>According to Numina, in order to reach the Nexus of Thorns, <color lightgreen>first weaken the tree itself. Once in its chamber, destroy all the vines</color>. You'll have to work quickly, because they'll regrow if you let them. <br><br>Once that's done, <color lightgreen>the outer layer of the tree will be vulnerable. Attack it</color>, and destroy it to reveal the nexus of thorns. <br><br>Then, <color lightgreen>touch the Nexus of Thorns</color>, and you should be able to gather its power. <br><br>Good luck, heroes."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P234469178" "Take the Nexus of Thorns"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3376966810" "<color deepskyblue>Ms. Liberty TASKFORCE:  'Plucking the Thorn' <br>Part: Three<br><br></color>Remember, first clear out the vines in the Thorn Tree's chamber. <br><br>Next, break through the outer layer of the tree itself. <br><br>Finally, you'll only have to touch the Nexus of Thorns to take the power you'll need to defeat Dr. Aeon."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1932399311" "The Tree of Thorns is buried deeply in here, somewhere. It's power may be the only thing that can capture Dr. Aeon!"
// Script Variable DisplayTitle :
"P2475770850" "Vine Counter"
// Script Variable DisplayTooltip :
"P3205365633" "Defeat vines to make Tree cyst attackable"
// Script Variable CountText :
"P2030509952" "Vines to destroy:"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME1 :
"P1995534572" "Dr. Eva Lone"
// Script Variable BOSS1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P144563360" "Curse that Demon! I think this is the right way. <em>Sure. <em>Really! Plenty of times! <em>These ruins aren't easy to navigate! <em>The maps are incomplete! <em>Never! <em>This is my mission and I formed this team! <em>... <em>If you're so good, how about you take point to draw agro when we get to the tree?"
// Script Variable BOSS1_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1658126004" "This is my mission! What are you doing here?"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME2 :
"P184746944" "Sardonic"
// Script Variable BOSS2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1658589859" "Uh-huh? <em>Have you ever done this before? <em>Ha! Right! <em>Then how come you're lost? <em>That's why I'm downloading a map from the internet right now. <em>Just let me be the leader already. <em>I'm blogging how much you suck right now. <em>Uhhh..."
// Script Variable BOSS2_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3015350201" "N00b!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME3 :
"P1943974985" "Contemptress"
// Script Variable BOSS3_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2985060124" "Every one of you is an idiot!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME4 :
"P2715944972" "Misadventure"
// Script Variable BOSS4_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2083153132" "Hold on. Gotta kill some weirdos. I'll call you back."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME5 :
"P2788476222" "Comrade"
// Script Variable BOSS5_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P8514793" "The only thing I like better than American rock-and-roll is killing heroes!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME6 :
"P273500118" "Bad Penny"
// Script Variable BOSS6_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3215201480" "TAILS AGAIN! I CAN'T STAND IT ANYMORE!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME7 :
"P4137812445" "Pyrelord"
// Script Variable BOSS7_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P11279427" "Did you know that I like fire?"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME8 :
"P1630882996" "Dark Sabaoth"
// Script Variable BOSS8_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1127807129" "From the heart of darkness, I stab at thee!"
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1524192887" "<shout>The Tree of Thorns is hurt! We must protect it!"
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2400016967" "<shout>Protect the Tree! Destroy the infidels!"
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2575403992" "<shout>The Tree of Thorns is nearly dead! Slay the intruders!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2717656149" "Death Mage"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P654851634" "Can we never get any peace around here?"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P591688595" "What are heroes doing here?"

