"P3168919759" "Silver Mantis"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3397653702" "Scorpion is going to owe me a lot for babysitting this nerd."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1893257158" "C'mon, Heroes. I'll take you all at once!"
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
