// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3374707496" "Mmmmm! You hurt me so good!"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3589894969" "The pain! The anger! Yes! You really know how to treat a girl!"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P986418479" "Oh yes! OH YES! This is a battle!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P3611003251" "That's it... <em>I'm spent. <em>Take the code, you earned it."
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
