// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3005919040" "Silver Mantis had part of the code to Dr. Aeon's lab on her."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1445030749" "Barracuda"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1323929999" "I don't see the point of this. Aeon's perfectly safe inside his force-field."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1468608436" "Let's get this over with."
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P2263926204" "Just die!"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2780550862" "Just stop living already!"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1663533430" "You stupid idiots! I hate all of you!"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P864062672" "Why couldn't you all just die?"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P3555239044" "I never wanted to do this anyway."
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P1444876922" "This isn't personal. I really don't care about any of this."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - DefeatBarrie 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P2877727777" "Defeat Barracuda"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P639191735" "Barracuda had part of the code to Dr. Aeon's lab on her."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3033318358" "Ice Mistral"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P682584976" "How long do we have to be here? <em>Bored, bored, bored! <em>Who does Scirocco think he is, making me do this? <em>I should be out doing something important! <em>And I already finished my magazine."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3755327147" "Heroes! Just the thing to prove my true value to Scirocco!"
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P2008018368" "Feel the chill fury of the Ice Mistral! <em>That's my new catch-phrase. Isn't it cool?"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P272414905" "Hey, I felt that! You jerks! You're just supposed to die!"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1152313649" "How can I prove myself if you idiots don't let me kill you?!"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3151252903" "I'm better than this! I'm better than any of you!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P1975143092" "How could I have lost... <em>to the likes... <em>of you..?"
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P369641841" "See? I really am the best! It just comes naturally."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - DefeatMisty 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P1016977322" "Defeat Ice Mistral"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3672039891" "Ice Mistral had part of the code to Dr. Aeon's lab on her."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3796300214" "Heroes! In my inner sanctum? This is inconceivable!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1162932864" "Fortunately, I have my impenetrable force-field to make me invincible!"
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P2465352787" "If knowledge is power, then I am the king of the world!"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2729821657" "My force-field was scientifically perfect! How can this be happening?"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P991783221" "You heroes, with your primitive minds! You're stupid! Stupid!"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P879304241" "I took all variables into account! This is inconceivable!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P383963902" "It doesn't matter... <em>You'll never stand a chance against Recluse... <em>and my creation..."
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P1838512022" "Ha! I hypothesize that you have just been 'Aeonnihilated'!"
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P1189014130" "Based on empirical evidence, I conclude that you suck!"
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P3250837994" "I took no pleasure in that. It's all for science. Really."
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P4283179962" "In layman's terms, you've just been pwn3d by science!"
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P640174432" "If I were your a professor, I'd give you an 'F' for effort."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - FallOfTheCorpOfAeon 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P796017400" "You have defeated Dr. Aeon!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2393836638" "You have captured Dr. Aeon"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1932668518" "<color deepskyblue>Ms. Liberty TASKFORCE:  'A Visit to the Doctor' <br>Part: Four<br><br></color>Dr. Aeon is in Longbow custody. While all the nations with a claim on him for numerous crimes against humanity, he's been all too eager to tell us what he's done. It's worse than anything we could have predicted."
// RandomFameString :
"P731209550" "Did you hear! A group of heroes working together as {TaskForceName} brought in Dr. Aeon! Incredible!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P557478840" "<color deepskyblue>Ms. Liberty TASKFORCE:  'A Gauntlet of Evil' <br>Part: Finale<br><br></color>Dr. Aeon's boasting has finally revealed the purpose of the Web. It's a techno magical construct designed to draw in a wide variety of super-human powers, then transmit that power to one individual: <color red>Lord Recluse!</color> <br><br>If our figures are correct, it could transfer nearly all the power of every super-human in the world directly to Lord Recluse within 24 hours. If Recluse is able to activate the Web, it will be the end of freedom on our world, and possibly, in our universe. <color lightgreen>Recluse must be stopped.</color> If he succeeds, he'll become a <i>monster</i>, {HeroName}. For all the evil that he's done, Recluse is still my uncle. I believe that he has a chance to change, but there'll be no coming back for him if he succeeds in this."
// AcceptString :
"P2039330130" "Stop Lord Recluse!"
// SendOffString :
"P1642333609" "<color deepskyblue>Ms. Liberty TASKFORCE:  'A Gauntlet of Evil' <br>Part: Finale<br><br></color>Our analysis has given us a bit of hope. <br><br>First, in order to preserve his troops and protect himself from the device, Recluse has set a safe area around Grandville Island. Secondly, while he's tuned the device to always effect certain heroes, including me and every member of the Freedom Phalanx and the Vindicators, none of you were on that target list. This means that while none of us can approach Grandville without giving Recluse even more power, Arachnos activity outside of the Rogue Isles will be cut to nearly nothing once the Web activates. And if we can get you inside the radius before then, there just might be a chance to stop him. <br><br>Your goal is to bring Recluse to battle before the Web is fully activated. Defeat his soldiers, and most importantly his captains to bring him out. If he does activate the Web, try to destroy his interface with it, and then defeat him. The feedback should render the Web itself useless. <br><br>Good luck, {TaskForceName}. The world is depending on you."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1200535861" "<color deepskyblue>Ms. Liberty TASKFORCE:  'A Gauntlet of Evil' <br>Part: Finale<br><br></color>I'm feeling weaker already, but there's no time to worry about that. Your goal is to bring Recluse to battle before the Web is fully activated. Defeat his soldiers, and most importantly his captains to bring him out. If he does activate the Web, try to destroy his interface with it, and then defeat him. The feedback should render the Web itself useless, but it will not be easy. <br><br>Good luck, {TaskForceName}. The world is depending on you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2220635207" "The Helicopter lands on the deck of a Longbow ship that's fought it's way here. Before you stands Grandville, the lair of Lord Recluse."
// Script Variable PATRON1_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3148347594" "Ghost Widow"
// Script Variable PATRON1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3066869691" "<shout>Do we all stand ready to protect Lord Recluse?"
// Script Variable PATRON1_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1192280878" "Lord Recluse does not appreciate this intrusion."
// Script Variable PATRON2_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2855812872" "Scirocco"
// Script Variable PATRON2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3379157177" "<shout>It is odd, but this is the first time, in a long time, that we've all been united like this."
// Script Variable PATRON2_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2868216281" "The time for talk is over. Let battle rage!"
// Script Variable PATRON3_DISPLAYNAME :
"P4105631639" "Black Scorpion"
