// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P4045292664" "This was Paragon's best? Disappointing."
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P2365055293" "You were barely worth my time."
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P675888341" "You'll save nothing, hero."
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P4063455267" "Failure suits you, hero."

