// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2226684662" "With Recluse's defeat, the power of the Web begins to burn itself out. The threat is passed, and the day has been saved!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1558356824" "<color deepskyblue>Ms. Liberty TASKFORCE:  'A Gauntlet of Evil' <br>Part: Finale<br><br></color><color lightgreen>Recluse is defeated, and his plans are in ruins</color>. Look over this great city, and see what you have done today! Every person who lives in freedom from this day forward owes that freedom to your valor, your determination, and your heroism.<br><br>Perhaps this defeat will show Recluse that the heroes of Paragon City will always be stronger than his own vile plans. Maybe it will even make him think twice about how he's using all of his power. Power used for evil will only come to an end, but if it's used for good...<br><br>Sorry, I'm rambling. Thank you for all your help, the world owes you a great debt, {TaskForceName}!"
// RandomFameString :
"P3755767733" "The heroes of {TaskForceName} will live in honor forever!"

